namespace FlexFlow{
/**

\page file-format-v1 pcg/file_format/v1

\brief V1 file format for serializing and deserializing FlexFlow datastructures to and from disk.

\section file-format-v1-machine-specification Machine Specification

\code{.json}
{
  "__type": "V1MachineSpecification",
  "num_nodes": 8,
  "num_cpus_per_node": 32,
  "num_gpus_per_node": 4,
  "inter_node_bandwidth_bytes_per_second": 58.0,
  "intra_node_bandwidth_bytes_per_second": 32.0
}
\endcode

Note that the <tt>__type</tt> field is not necessary.
It is output by FlexFlow to be helpful, but ommitting it in your handwritten JSON is also fine.

*/
}
